        },
        {
          "text": "Man giketho utur i wigi, gikok kumae, ku ywak man can, giwacu, Can, can, adhura ma dit, ma i ie dhanu ceke ma gibedo ku combo migi i pi juketho gilony ni kum lonyo pare! kum i saa acel juketho edong’ lwe. ",
